          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu wako ungi uchaasigharika moyo nisemwinjire madhabahunyi kwapo, uchasigharika tu kwa kukubonya kodelilaghaa na kukaia na wasi ngolonyi; na wandu wa kivalwa chako chose, wichakaia wikibwaghwa ni wandu wudenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na alama ekuwonyera wuloli ghwa maza iri ni ihi: wana wako wawi, Hofni na Finehasi, wichafwa wose kwa ituku jimweri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
