            "sid": "1SA 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani nichawika mkohani mzima uchaakaia mloli kwapo, nao moni uchabonya agho nighikundagha. Nichamneka kinyumba chimange chichaadumika imbiri ya msaghulwa wapo matuku ghose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kula umu wa kinyumba chako uchaasigharika, uchamghendia uo mkohani na kumvoya ukilomba pesa na vindo kwa kumlomba umngire andenyi ya wudumiki ghwa wukohani eri upate kindo chingi cheja.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.36"
            ]
          }
